        <!-- Closing CTA -->
        <div class="mt-16 bg-gray-900 text-white rounded-2xl p-8">
          <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-white mb-4">The Bottom Line</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            <strong class="text-white">Use Adventure Sync, keep the phone in your pocket, and be patient.</strong>
            Pokémon GO cannot see treadmill walking on its map, but Adventure Sync can credit the
            distance Apple Health or Google Fit records from your phone’s motion sensors, even with
            the game closed. Manually entered distance does not count, and syncing can take hours.
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4">
            Do not spoof your location: the game’s fairness policy treats it as cheating and can end in a
